{"id":332,"date":"2016-05-16T12:57:36","date_gmt":"2016-05-16T12:57:36","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/masterbadminton.dev\/badminton-super-series-premier-victor-korea-open-2012-quarter-final-matches\/"},"modified":"2016-08-31T10:08:27","modified_gmt":"2016-08-31T10:08:27","slug":"victor-korea-open-2012-quarter-finals-html","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/victor-korea-open-2012-quarter-finals.html","title":{"rendered":"Badminton Super Series Premier: Victor Korea Open 2012 Quarter Final Matches"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"ContentColumn\">\n<div class=\"Liner\">\n<div style=\"float: left;\"><\/div>\n<p>Event: Victor Korea Open 2012 Quarter Final (Super Series Premier)<\/p>\n<table border=\"1\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Location:<\/b><\/td>\n<td>Seoul, Korea<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Date: <\/b><\/td>\n<td>6 January 2012<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Prize Money:<\/b><\/td>\n<td>1,000,000USD<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Bae Youn Joo (KOR) v Li Xuerui (CHN)<\/h3>\n<p><b>Category:<\/b> Women&#8217;s Singles<br \/>\n<b>Winner:<\/b> Bae Youn Joo<br \/>\n<b>Score:<\/b> 21-18 21-16<\/p>\n<div align=\"center\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/S4gKx9Q8Rg4\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/div>\n<h3>Jung Jae Sung\/Lee Yong Dae (KOR) v Fang Chieh Min\/Lee Sheng Mu (TPE)<\/h3>\n<p><b>Category:<\/b> Men&#8217;s Doubles<br \/>\n<b>Winner:<\/b> Jung Jae Sung\/Lee Yong Dae<br \/>\n<b>Score:<\/b> 21-16 21-12<\/p>\n<div align=\"center\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/ThpwYewjYAE\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/div>\n<p>The shuttles were flying relatively slower at the Seoul Olympic Stadium. (<a href=\"badminton-shuttle.html\">click here to understand how shuttles can fly at different speeds in different countries<\/a>).<\/p>\n<p>Both sides found it very easy to defend against their opponents&#8217; smashes. It was extremely difficult to get the shuttlecock onto the ground.<\/p>\n<p>Eventually Lee Yong Dae started exchanging clears with the Taiwanese opponents.<\/p>\n<p>We <em>rarely<\/em> see this in badminton doubles today!<\/p>\n<p>Both sides were tired and not motivated to attack because neither side could produce the powerful shots they wanted.<\/p>\n<h3>Lee Chong Wei (MAS) v Kenichi Tago (JPN)<\/h3>\n<p><b>Category:<\/b> Men&#8217;s Singles<br \/>\n<b>Winner:<\/b> Lee Chong Wei<br \/>\n<b>Score:<\/b> 21-18 21-17<\/p>\n<div align=\"center\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/CvXSCLHoKJI\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/div>\n<h3>Tian Qing\/Zhao Yun Lei (CHN) v Miyuki Maeda\/Satoko Suetsuna (JPN)<\/h3>\n<p><b>Category:<\/b> Women&#8217;s Doubles<br \/>\n<b>Winner:<\/b> Tian Qing\/Zhao Yun Lei<br \/>\n<b>Score:<\/b> 21-16 21-18<\/p>\n<div align=\"center\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/eG2Yf0CAXRM\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/div>\n<h3>Lin Dan (CHN) v Jan O Jorgensen (DEN)<\/h3>\n<p><b>Category:<\/b> Men&#8217;s Singles<br \/>\n<b>Winner:<\/b> Lin Dan<br \/>\n<b>Score:<\/b> 21-13 8-21 21-15<\/p>\n<div align=\"center\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/9Xo5fS0PB0E\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/div>\n<p>Super Dan was literally toying around in this match. He tried several fancy and ambitious shots against Jorgensen.<\/p>\n<p>The Victor Korea Open 2012 was Jorgensen&#8217;s first tournament after a long break. He suffered a bad year in 2011 because he had a heart problem which forced him out for a while. Besides that, his mother passed away not long after he had the injury.<\/p>\n<div class=\"retnvbx1\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"fb-comments-intro-ns\">\n<div class=\"retnvbx\"><\/div>\n<h3><span class=\"teelmeww\">Tell me what you think!<\/span><\/h3>\n<p>What do you think about what you just read? Leave me a comment below.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"fblikeste\">Like Masterbadminton.com?<\/h3>\n<div align=\"left\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div align=\"center\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Event: Victor Korea Open 2012 Quarter Final (Super Series Premier) Location: Seoul, Korea Date: 6 January 2012 Prize Money: 1,000,000USD Bae Youn Joo (KOR) v Li Xuerui (CHN) Category: Women&#8217;s Singles Winner: Bae Youn Joo Score: 21-18 21-16 Jung Jae Sung\/Lee Yong Dae (KOR) v Fang Chieh Min\/Lee Sheng Mu (TPE) Category: Men&#8217;s Doubles Winner: [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[21],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-332","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-badminton-videos"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v25.6 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Badminton Super Series Premier: Victor Korea Open 2012 Quarter Finals<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Victor Korea Open 2012 video highlights of the quarter finals!\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/victor-korea-open-2012-quarter-finals.html\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Badminton Super Series Premier: Victor Korea Open 2012 Quarter Finals\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Victor Korea Open 2012 video highlights of the quarter finals!\" \/>\n